Package: dtroadmap
Title: Digital Transformation Roadmap Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Frenk", "Giorgetti", email = "frenk.giorgetti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny app that links transformation enablers to processes, KPIs
    and value. Calculates cost and value profiles from a small set of
    configurable assumptions and runs a sensitivity analysis on them.
